      `notice of the adoption of the resolution and of the meeting of stockholders was given to each stockholder entitled to vote as of the record date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was notice of the resolution and of the stockholders' meeting given to each stockholder entitled to vote as of the record date?
      `the votes for the proposed dissolution` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes of the outstanding stock were cast for the dissolution?
      `the votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon` IS A NUMBER @desc How many votes does all the outstanding stock entitled to vote carry?
      `the number of stockholders entitled to vote who consented in writing` IS A NUMBER @desc If you are acting by written consent: how many stockholders entitled to vote consented in writing (0 if none)?
      `the number of stockholders entitled to vote` IS A NUMBER @desc How many stockholders are entitled to vote on the dissolution?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 275(a) to (c) the dissolution of our corporation is authorized` IS
    `s 275 the dissolution is authorized in accordance with this section` WITH `the resolution of the board was adopted by a majority of the whole board` IS (`s 275(a) the board adopted the resolution to dissolve by a majority of the whole board` WITH `the number of directors who voted for the resolution` IS `the number of directors who voted for the resolution`, `the number of directors constituting the whole board` IS `the number of directors constituting the whole board`), `the board did what s 275(a) requires before the stockholders voted` IS (`s 275(a) the board has done what the subsection requires before the stockholders vote` WITH `the meeting of the board was called for the purpose of the resolution` IS `the meeting of the board was called for the purpose of the resolution`, `notice of the adoption of the resolution and of the meeting of stockholders was given to each stockholder entitled to vote as of the record date` IS `notice of the adoption of the resolution and of the meeting of stockholders was given to each stockholder entitled to vote as of the record date`), `a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote voted for the proposed dissolution` IS (`s 275(b) a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote has voted for the proposed dissolution` WITH `the votes for the proposed dissolution` IS `the votes for the proposed dissolution`, `the votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon` IS `the votes of the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon`), `all the stockholders entitled to vote consented in writing` IS (`s 275(c) all the stockholders entitled to vote have consented in writing to the dissolution` WITH `the number of stockholders entitled to vote who consented in writing` IS `the number of stockholders entitled to vote who consented in writing`, `the number of stockholders entitled to vote` IS `the number of stockholders entitled to vote`)

