ck entitled to vote thereon` IS `the votes of the members entitled to vote thereon`), `all the stockholders entitled to vote consented in writing` IS (`s 275(c) all the stockholders entitled to vote have consented in writing to the dissolution` WITH `the number of stockholders entitled to vote who consented in writing` IS `the number of members entitled to vote who consented in writing`, `the number of stockholders entitled to vote` IS `the number of members entitled to vote`)), `the dissolution is authorized by the vote of a majority of the members of the governing body then in office` IS (`s 276(a) a majority of the members of the governing body then in office voted for the resolution to dissolve` WITH `the number of members of the governing body who voted for the resolution to dissolve` IS `the number of members of the governing body who voted for the resolution to dissolve`, `the number of members of the governing body then in office` IS `the number of members of the governing body then in office`)

@ref 8 Del. C. § 276(b)
@export May a majority of our governing body (or, if there is none, of the incorporators) surrender the rights and franchises of our nonstock corporation because it has not commenced business (s 276(b))?
GIVEN `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the nonstock corporation commenced the business for which it was organized?
      `the corporation has a governing body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the corporation have a governing body?
      `the number of members of the governing body` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members does the governing body have (0 if none)?
      `the number of incorporators` IS A NUMBER @desc How many incorporators are there?
      `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS A NUMBER @desc How many of the governing body (or of the incorporators, if there is no governing body) execute and acknowledge the certificate?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 276(b) a majority of our governing body or incorporators may surrender the franchises of our nonstock corporation` IS
    `s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized`, `the corporation has a governing body` IS `the corporation has a governing body`, `the number of members of the governing body` IS `the number of members of the governing body`, `the number of incorporators` IS `the number of incorporators`, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate`

-- The rest of section 276(c) (the contents, the failure to file, the certificate of good standing) is the same as section 275(f): use the section 275(f) questions above.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 276(c)
