    `s 276(c) the nonstock corporation's certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence`, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 277
@export May our corporation be dissolved, merged, transferred or converted, having paid its franchise taxes and filed its annual reports, or once the Secretary of State certifies the instrument filed (s 277)?
GIVEN `all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the entire calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion becomes effective, have been paid by the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation paid all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the whole calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion takes effect?
      `all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it becomes effective, have been filed by the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has it filed all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it takes effect?
