      `the corporation has expired by its own limitation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation expired by its own limitation?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 278 sections 279 to 282 apply to our corporation` IS
    `s 278 sections 279 to 282 apply to the corporation as a dissolved corporation` WITH `the corporation has been dissolved` IS `the corporation has been dissolved`, `the corporation has expired by its own limitation` IS `the corporation has expired by its own limitation`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 279
@export May I apply to the Court of Chancery to appoint trustees or receivers for our dissolved corporation, as a creditor, stockholder or director, or on good cause shown (s 279)?
GIVEN `the corporation organized under this chapter has been dissolved in any manner whatever` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been dissolved in any manner whatever?
      `I am a creditor of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a creditor of the corporation?
      `I am a stockholder of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a stockholder of the corporation?
      `I am a director of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a director of the corporation?
      `the applicant shows good cause` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If you are none of these, can you show good cause for the appointment?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 279 I may apply for trustees or receivers for the dissolved corporation` IS
    `s 279 the Court of Chancery may act on the application to appoint trustees or receivers` WITH `the corporation organized under this chapter has been dissolved in any manner whatever` IS `the corporation organized under this chapter has been dissolved in any manner whatever`, `the applicant` IS `me as applicant`, `the applicant shows good cause` IS `the applicant shows good cause`
    WHERE
        `me as applicant` MEANS IF `I am a creditor of the corporation` THEN `a creditor` ELSE IF `I am a stockholder of the corporation` THEN `a stockholder` ELSE IF `I am a director of the corporation` THEN `a director` ELSE `another party named in the provision` "a person who may show good cause"

@ref 8 Del. C. § 279
@export May the Court of Chancery appoint me a trustee or a receiver of our dissolved corporation (s 279)?
