      `I am a director of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a director of the corporation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 279 I may be appointed trustee or receiver of the dissolved corporation` IS
    `s 279 the person may be appointed to the office` WITH `the office` IS (IF `the office is that of a trustee` THEN `a trustee` ELSE `a receiver`), `the appointee is a director of the corporation` IS `I am a director of the corporation`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 279
