DECIDE `s 291 the powers of the receivers of our insolvent corporation continue` IS
    `s 291 the powers of the receivers continue` WITH `the Court of Chancery deems the continuation of the powers necessary` IS `the Court of Chancery deems the continuation of the powers necessary`

