GIVEN `the instrument is a certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the instrument a certificate of incorporation?
      `the instrument is the charter of a corporation organized under any special act or any law of this State` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the instrument the charter of a corporation organized under a special act or any law of Delaware?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(a) this instrument is a certificate of incorporation for section 312` IS
    `s 312(a) the instrument is a certificate of incorporation for the purposes of section 312` WITH `the instrument is a certificate of incorporation` IS `the instrument is a certificate of incorporation`, `the instrument is the charter of a corporation organized under any special act or any law of this State` IS `the instrument is the charter of a corporation organized under any special act or any law of this State`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(b)
@export Has our certificate of incorporation become forfeited or void so that we may procure a revival, and not by a revocation or forfeiture under section 284 (s 312(b))?
GIVEN `the certificate of incorporation has become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the certificate of incorporation become forfeited or void under Title 8?
      `the certificate of incorporation has been revoked or forfeited pursuant to § 284` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it revoked or forfeited under section 284 (by the Court of Chancery on the Attorney General's motion)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(b) our corporation may procure a revival of its certificate of incorporation` IS
    `s 312(b) the corporation may procure a revival of its certificate of incorporation` WITH `the certificate of incorporation has become forfeited or void pursuant to this title` IS `the certificate of incorporation has become forfeited or void pursuant to this title`, `the certificate of incorporation has been revoked or forfeited pursuant to § 284` IS `the certificate of incorporation has been revoked or forfeited pursuant to § 284`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(c)
@export Is the revival of our certificate procured, authorized by the board or governing body under subsection (h) and by a certificate of revival executed, acknowledged and filed under section 103 (s 312(c))?
GIVEN `the board of directors or members of the governing body authorized the revival in accordance with subsection (h)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the board of directors or governing body authorize the revival in accordance with subsection (h)?
      `the certificate of revival was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the certificate of revival executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(c) the revival of our certificate is procured` IS
    `s 312(c) the revival is procured` WITH `the board of directors or members of the governing body authorized the revival in accordance with subsection (h)` IS `the board of directors or members of the governing body authorized the revival in accordance with subsection (h)`, `the certificate of revival was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103` IS `the certificate of revival was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(d)
@export Does our certificate of revival make the five statements section 312(d) requires (s 312(d))?
GIVEN `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation?
      `statement of the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated?
      `statement of the name of the corporation at the time its certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the name of the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void?
      `statement of the new name under which the corporation is to be revived` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the new name under which the corporation is to be revived? (needed only if subsection (f) requires a new name)
      `statement of the address of the registered office in this State, stated in accordance with § 131(c), and the name of the registered agent at that address` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the address of the registered office in Delaware (as section 131(c) requires) and the name of the registered agent at that address?
      `statement that the corporation desiring to be revived was organized under the laws of this State` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state that the corporation desiring to be revived was organized under the laws of Delaware?
      `statement of the date when the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void pursuant to this title, or that the validity of any revival has been brought into question` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state the date when the certificate became forfeited or void, or that the validity of any revival has been brought into question?
      `statement that the certificate is filed by authority of the board of directors or members of the governing body in accordance with subsection (h)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state that it is filed by authority of the board of directors or governing body in accordance with subsection (h)?
      `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does subsection (f) require the corporation to be revived under a new name?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(d) our certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` IS
    `s 312(d) the certificate of revival states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS `our certificate`, `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name` IS `subsection (f) requires the corporation to be revived under a new name`
    WHERE
        `our certificate` MEANS `s 312(d) Certificate of revival` WITH `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation` IS `statement of the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation`, `statement of the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated` IS `statement of the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated`, `statement of the name of the corporation at the time its certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS `statement of the name of the corporation at the time its certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void`, `statement of the new name under which the corporation is to be revived` IS `statement of the new name under which the corporation is to be revived`, `statement of the address of the registered office in this State, stated in accordance with § 131(c), and the name of the registered agent at that address` IS `statement of the address of the registered office in this State, stated in accordance with § 131(c), and the name of the registered agent at that address`, `statement that the corporation desiring to be revived was organized under the laws of this State` IS `statement that the corporation desiring to be revived was organized under the laws of this State`, `statement of the date when the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void pursuant to this title, or that the validity of any revival has been brought into question` IS `statement of the date when the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void pursuant to this title, or that the validity of any revival has been brought into question`, `statement that the certificate is filed by authority of the board of directors or members of the governing body in accordance with subsection (h)` IS `statement that the certificate is filed by authority of the board of directors or members of the governing body in accordance with subsection (h)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(e)
@export On the filing of the certificate of revival under section 103, is our corporation revived as if its certificate had never been forfeited or void (s 312(e))?
GIVEN `the certificate of revival was filed in accordance with § 103` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the certificate of revival filed in accordance with section 103?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(e) our corporation is revived with the same force and effect` IS
    `s 312(e) the corporation is revived with the same force and effect as if its certificate had not been forfeited or void` WITH `the certificate of revival was filed in accordance with § 103` IS `the certificate of revival was filed in accordance with § 103`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(e)
@export Does the revival validate this contract, act, matter or thing, made while our certificate was forfeited or void within its scope (s 312(e))?
GIVEN `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been revived under section 312(e)?
      `the person` IS A `s 312(e) Person who made, did or performed the contract, act, matter or thing` @desc Who made, did or performed it? One of: the corporation itself; a director or member of the governing body of the corporation; an officer of the corporation; an agent of the corporation; a stockholder or member of the corporation; someone else.
      `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation?
      `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it made, done or performed while the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(e) the revival validates what was done while the certificate was void` IS
    `s 312(e) the revival validates the contract, act, matter or thing` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)`, `the person` IS `the person`, `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation` IS `it was made, done or performed within the scope of the certificate of incorporation`, `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void` IS `it was made, done or performed during the time when the certificate of incorporation was forfeited or void`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(e)
@export Is this property, right or credit vested in the corporation after its revival (s 312(e))?
GIVEN `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been revived under section 312(e)?
      `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did it belong to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void, and was it not disposed of before the revival?
      `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(e) property acquired while the certificate was void is vested in the revived corporation` IS
    `s 312(e) the property, right or credit is vested in the corporation after its revival` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)`, `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival` IS `the property, right or credit belonged to the corporation when its certificate became forfeited or void and was not disposed of before the revival`, `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void` IS `the property, right or credit was acquired by the corporation after its certificate became forfeited or void`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(e)
@export Is the revived corporation exclusively liable for what its directors, officers, agents and stockholders did in its name and on its behalf before the revival, so that I am not personally liable (s 312(e))?
GIVEN `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the corporation been revived under section 312(e)?
      `the person` IS A `s 312(e) Person who made, did or performed the contract, act, matter or thing` @desc Who made, did or performed it? One of: the corporation itself; a director or member of the governing body of the corporation; an officer of the corporation; an agent of the corporation; a stockholder or member of the corporation; someone else.
      `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation before its revival?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(e) the revived corporation is exclusively liable for what was done in its name before the revival` IS
    `s 312(e) the corporation is as exclusively liable for the contract, act, matter or thing as if its certificate had at all times remained in force` WITH `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)` IS `the corporation has been revived under section 312(e)`, `the person` IS `the person`, `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival` IS `it was made, done or performed in the name and on behalf of the corporation prior to its revival`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(f)
@export Must our corporation be revived under some other name, because since the certificate became void another Delaware or a qualified foreign corporation has taken the same or a nearly similar name (s 312(f))?
GIVEN `since the certificate became forfeited or void, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Since the certificate became forfeited or void, has another Delaware corporation adopted the same name, or one so nearly similar as not to distinguish it?
      `since the certificate became forfeited or void, a foreign corporation qualified in accordance with § 371 has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a foreign corporation qualified under section 371 adopted the same name, or one so nearly similar as not to distinguish it?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 312(f) our corporation must be revived under some other name` IS
    `s 312(f) the corporation to be revived must be revived under some other name` WITH `since the certificate became forfeited or void, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS `since the certificate became forfeited or void, another corporation organized under the laws of this State has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it`, `since the certificate became forfeited or void, a foreign corporation qualified in accordance with § 371 has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it` IS `since the certificate became forfeited or void, a foreign corporation qualified in accordance with § 371 has adopted the same name as the corporation to be revived, or a name so nearly similar as not to distinguish it`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(g)
@export What do we pay the State on revival: the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due when our certificate became void, or, if it was void for more than 5 years, 3 times the annual franchise tax for the year of revival (s 312(g))?
GIVEN `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS A NUMBER @desc What franchise taxes, penalties and interest were due when the certificate became forfeited or void?
      `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS A NUMBER @desc What annual franchise tax would be due for the year of the revival, at the then current rate?
      `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the certificate become forfeited or void?
      `the date the revival is effected` IS A DATE @desc On what date is the revival effected?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `s 312(g) the sum we pay to the State on revival` IS
    `s 312(g) the sum the corporation pays to this State on revival` WITH `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS `the franchise taxes, penalties and interest due at the time the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void`, `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation` IS `the annual franchise tax that would be due and payable for the year in which the revival is effected, at the then current rate of taxation`, `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void` IS `the date the certificate of incorporation became forfeited or void`, `the date the revival is effected` IS `the date the revival is effected`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(g)
@export Does the sum we pay on revival reduce the franchise tax due for the year of the revival? What is still due (s 312(g))?
GIVEN `the franchise tax due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected` IS A NUMBER @desc What franchise tax is due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected?
      `the payment made pursuant to subsection (g)` IS A NUMBER @desc What payment do you make under section 312(g)?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `s 312(g) the franchise tax still due for the year of the revival` IS
    `s 312(g) the franchise tax still due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected` WITH `the franchise tax due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected` IS `the franchise tax due under Chapter 5 for the year in which the revival is effected`, `the payment made pursuant to subsection (g)` IS `the payment made pursuant to subsection (g)`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 312(g)
