      `I am a stockholder of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a stockholder of the corporation?
      `notice is given in accordance with § 222` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Will notice be given in accordance with section 222?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
